               <p rend="justify">A DUTIFUL PARENT.</p>
               <lg>
                  <l>Cried a cat to his wife, “See, my dear,</l>
                  <l>The superlative Circus is here!</l>
                  <l>With the children we’ll go,—’tis our duty, you know,</l>
                  <l>Their young minds to enlighten and cheer.”</l>
               </lg>
               <p rend="justify">image</p>
               <p rend="justify">Said a Cat to his sons, “I should deem<lb/>This blithe Picture-Book Boy carried cream.”</p>
               <p rend="justify"> </p>
